-  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap9 mapper probe.]
+  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap10 mapper probe.]
 
-  Description [stmap9 tests a middle-slack area-relief refinement of the
-  stmap8 arrival-bounded high-fanout wide-cut guard. It keeps the same
-  graph-size, slack, and high-fanout protection, but exact-area recovery
-  may allow an area-saving wide high-fanout cut in the one-to-two inverter
-  slack bucket when the candidate is outside the highest fanout bucket,
-  does not worsen mapper arrival, and saves at least one inverter area.]
+  Description [stmap10 tests a depth-qualified refinement of the stmap9
+  middle-slack area-relief high-fanout wide-cut guard. It keeps the same
+  arrival-neutral and area-saving middle-slack override, but allows it only
+  in shallow and medium-depth mapper nodes, leaving deep reconvergent nodes
+  on the stricter stmap8-style arrival-bounded guard.]
 
   SideEffects []
 
   SeeAlso     []
 
 ***********************************************************************/
